<title>UK: Wuerttemberg Hypo sets 100 mln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemberg Hypo sets 100 mln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsceh Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    02.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.70     PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    STUTTGART PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	**81 PCT TIMES THE 10-YEAR REX INDEX</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 871.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
